The WadaPakka demo is implemented and running at **http://127.0.0.1:8000**. It has paired naive and reliability pipelines, mic and typed turns, Timbre read back, confirmation before the layer writes, an idempotent ledger, human handoff, and a turn timeline. Live Timbre → Prisma calls and the app’s audio and TTS routes succeeded.

Run it later with `.venv/bin/uvicorn app:app --port 8000`. The saved synthetic audio eval scored **2/3 exact slot triples**; the layer made **0 unconfirmed writes**. The text scenarios scored 1/8 naive and 8/8 layer, but use different supplied transcripts and are not a measured model improvement. Details are in [eval results](/Users/shubhamindulkar/gnani-reliability-layer/docs/eval_results.md). **Six tests pass.**

